Evil Blueprints were added in '''Beta 36.0'''. As a 3/4 for 4G, it had a Magic effect that lets you look at 3 random monsters with a Tribe and a cost of 10G or lower and choose 1 of them. It would then be added to your hand, but instead of its own Tribe, it had all Tribes, making it function identical to [[Thrashing Machine]]. '''Beta 43.0''' removed the need for the monster chosen to have a Tribe at all.

'''Beta 56.0''' gave it -1/-2 and -2G, leaving it at 2/2/2. Its Magic was turned simply into a Delay that added a Thrashing Machine to your hand. (Thrashing Machine was made into a Token monster in this update.) '''Beta 56.1''' gave it +1 HP.
